\hl{(4)~\textit{model auto-sync} --- several participants were unaware they needed to manually select a model in Tokalator when switching models in the Copilot chat UI. v3.1.2 addresses this by reading \texttt{request.model} on every \texttt{@tokalator} chat request and automatically syncing the context window, tokenizer, and rot threshold to match the active Copilot model via \texttt{findModel()}.} Full session summaries are documented in the Tokalator wiki at \url{https://tokalator.wiki/events}.

