\section{Survey Instrument and Aggregated Results}
\label{app:survey}

\hl{This appendix provides the full 10-item survey instrument used in} Section~\ref{sec:survey}\hl{, the participant demographic profile (including gender distribution: 35~Male, 13~Female, 2~Non-binary or undisclosed), aggregated Likert-scale response distributions with bar charts, the five-theme qualitative summary, and representative verbatim quotes.}

%% ── A.5.1 Survey Questions ────────────────────────────────────────
\subsection*{A.5.1 \quad Survey Questions (10 Items)}

\hl{The survey comprised 10 items delivered via Google Forms after participants used the Tokalator extension for at least one full working day. Items~1--5 address the five core features (preview, tokenizer, model sync, session management, and compaction); Items~6--10 cover overall usability, recommendation intent, ease of installation, dashboard clarity, and enterprise feature interest. All items used a five-point Likert scale (1 = Strongly~Disagree / Not~Useful; 5 = Strongly~Agree / Very~Useful). Each rated item was followed by an optional open-text explanation field, whose responses were inductively coded into the five themes reported in} Section~\ref{sec:survey}.

